on<BR>Kila</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Daleldare</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial"> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Wegluan Runsalot:<BR><B>Woooot!!!!!<P>Less than 30 days to go and this deployment is OVER lol. Cant wait till I get back to Cali and rehook my puter from storage and get back into playing EQ again. After spending 36 days in Valdez, Alaska this Okinawa tropical weather is wearing me down lol it will take me about 3 weeks to re-climatize but by then I will be on my way back stateside. Then it will be balls to the wall (forgive my expression lol) on getting my faction up with Coldains again and level up my alts so more. It will be fun to rejoin old friends again. I like to thank those who kept in contact with me and kept me informed to whats happening in the guild since i been gone. I know theres been quite a few changes and i truly hope Sublime stays as great of a guild as it always has been.  Well i need to get back to work so i can check another day off my calendar. Basanee....you better sharpen those fishy hooks, and Momma B... you better have that scolding looking and your bonking stick prepared lol, Kilamori.... your taxi service is enroute   <IMG SRC="http://www.forsaken.seventhhammer.com/ubb/smile.gif"> <P>Cya all soon <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Weg hurry home we miss ya!!<BR></FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Allys WindyBard</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Hey Weg you be my taxi to? lol hurry up I think I might pass your alts soon if I havent yet.</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Wegluan Runsalot</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">I hope you dont pass up my alts lol I will need someone to group up with once i get back and re-learn my characters lol. If you do pass them up then no taxi for you, young lady........ j/k  But anyway it looks like I will be back in the states on the 14th of June. I will have 4 days off to set up my puter in the barracks and start my phone service and attempt to get my Explorer restarted since its been in storage for the past 6 months.  Then I will be flying out to Oklahoma to visit some friends for a couple weeks until the 4th of July weekend. Afetr that then I will be able to put more time into my chars and hopefully get my new puter so i can enjoy Luclin and all these new changes. <P>------------------<BR>Wegluan Runsalot <P>Lvl 51 Wanderer</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>
